// FUNCTION: BFME2 0x004565BD size=360 name=?getRandomSurfacePosition@BridgeBehavior@@IAEXPAVTerrainRoadType@@PBVBridgeInfo@@PAUCoord3D@@@Z evidence=N:ledger
void BridgeBehavior::getRandomSurfacePosition(TerrainRoadType *bridgeTemplate, const BridgeInfo *bridgeInfo, Coord3D *pos)
{
	if (bridgeInfo == 0 || pos == 0)
		return;

	// pick the spot by finding vectors along the edge of the bridge region, scaling them and adding them together
	Real scale;

	Coord3D v1;
	v1.x = bridgeInfo->toLeft.x - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.x;
	v1.y = bridgeInfo->toLeft.y - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.y;
	v1.z = bridgeInfo->toLeft.z - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.z;
	scale = GetGameLogicRandomValueReal(0.0f, 1.0f, "C:\\projects\\bfme2patch103\\bfme2\\Code\\GameEngine\\Source\\GameLogic\\Object\\Behavior\\BridgeBehavior.cpp", 0x1f6);
	v1.x *= scale;
	v1.y *= scale;
	v1.z *= scale;

	Coord3D v2;
	v2.x = bridgeInfo->fromRight.x - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.x;
	v2.y = bridgeInfo->fromRight.y - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.y;
	v2.z = bridgeInfo->fromRight.z - bridgeInfo->fromLeft.z;
	scale = GetGameLogicRandomValueReal(0.0f, 1.0f, "C:\\projects\\bfme2patch103\\bfme2\\Code\\GameEngine\\Source\\GameLogic\\Object\\Behavior\\BridgeBehavior.cpp", 0x1ff);
	v2.x *= scale;
	v2.y *= scale;
	v2.z *= scale;

	pos->x = v1.x + v2.x + bridgeInfo->fromLeft.x;
	pos->y = v1.y + v2.y + bridgeInfo->fromLeft.y;
	pos->z = v1.z + v2.z + bridgeInfo->fromLeft.z;

	// an additional Z component so effects can be created in a "cube" on and above the bridge
	pos->z += GetGameLogicRandomValueReal(0.0f, bridgeTemplate->getTransitionEffectsHeight(), "C:\\projects\\bfme2patch103\\bfme2\\Code\\GameEngine\\Source\\GameLogic\\Object\\Behavior\\BridgeBehavior.cpp", 0x20d);
}

